WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.760 --> 00:00:03.920
There is an order to things

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:07.160
That's what we do here...

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:09.360
...we keep order

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:23.600
Replicants are like any other machine

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:27.820
they're either a benefit or a hazard

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:31.800
If they're a benefit it's not my problem

00:01:19.960 --> 00:01:21.960
I had your job once

00:01:25.540 --> 00:01:26.720
I was good at

00:01:33.120 --> 00:01:34.840
Things were simpler then

